	Whenever a player puts on a piece of armor it immediately becomes
apparent what that armor's enchantment is.  Why is this not so when a player
wields a weapon?  At the very least, a weapon's enchantment should become
known when that player uses that weapon in combat.  IMHO it would be a good
idea if in the next version of nethack a player could find out a weapon's
enchantment (numerical, not (un)cursed/blessed status) upon either wielding
it or using it in combat.
